  "title": "Integra Enters Into Equity Agreement with the Shoshone-Paiute Tribes - Integra Resources",
  "summary": "Vancouver, British Columbia – May 13, 2026 – Integra Resources Corp. (“Integra” or the “Company”) (TSXV: ITR; NYSE American: ITRG) and the Shoshone-Paiute Tribes (the “Shoshone-Paiute”) are pleased to announce they have entered into an agreement pursuant to which Integra will grant 517,103 common shares of the Company (the “Common Shares”) to the Shoshone-Paiute with an aggregate value of US$1,500,000 […]",
